    "what_i_actually_checked": "Downloaded and parsed the node-draw filtered network (node_draw_GRN.zip, 3.2 MB) and the unfiltered network (unfiltered_GRN.zip, 2.9 MB) from the public S3 bucket, plus one atlas gene-set file (cell_atlas_from_enrichr.gmt) and single_perturbation_gses.txt. Filtered network: 67,650 'upregulates' + 63,531 'downregulates' rows = 131,181 edges, 1,559 nodes, 700 distinct source transcription factors (TFs), 1,559 distinct targets. Columns are source, relation, target, z_score, p_value, source_label, target_label; zero missing values, zero duplicate source-target pairs within a sign, zero pairs carrying both signs, 549 self-loops. Unfiltered network = 189,116 + 184,134 = 373,250 edges with no statistics columns. Cell atlas file has 131 gene sets; single_perturbation_gses.txt lists 10,901 GEO (Gene Expression Omnibus) study accessions.",
    "what_came_from_paper_text_only": "The construction pipeline (ChEA3 transcription factor enrichment run on RummaGEO differential expression gene sets, edge counts thresholded at 10, significance from shuffled-network nulls), the benchmarking against TRRUST (2,597 TF-TF edges) and TRANSFAC/JASPAR position weight matrices (32,067 edges), and everything about the ChEA-KG-TS time-series webserver. Europe PMC's supplementary file endpoint timed out, so supplementary tables were not retrieved."
  },
